---
import Layout from '../layouts/layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Returns, Repairs and Maintenance Policy | Kitchen And All" description="Return window, repair coverage, return costs and maintenance terms for Kitchen And All customers in Kenya.">
  <section class="min-h-[60vh] bg-slate-50 px-4 py-28">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl rounded-[2rem] border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-2xl md:p-14">
      <p class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-orange-600">Returns Policy</p>
      <h1 class="mt-6 text-4xl font-black text-slate-900">Returns, repairs and maintenance</h1>
      <div class="mt-8 space-y-8 leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900">Return window</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">For products we supply and install, report a fault or installation issue within the first 30 days after installation. This 30-day period is our free maintenance and repair window. If an item arrives damaged, incomplete, or different from the confirmed order, contact us within 48 hours of delivery with photographs where possible.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900">When we pay the return cost</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">If the problem is caused by our product or installation and is reported within the 30-day installation window, we will inspect and repair it at no charge. If it cannot be repaired and the fault is our responsibility, we will arrange its return and exchange it for a suitable replacement. We will confirm the collection or delivery arrangements with you.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900">When the customer pays</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">If the issue results from misuse, incorrect operation, negligence, accident, unauthorised modification, or normal wear and tear, the customer is responsible for the return, assessment, repair, and maintenance costs. Return charges are usually up to 40% of the product cost, depending on the extent of the damage, plus any applicable maintenance charges. We will provide an assessment and cost estimate before chargeable work begins.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900">Custom and special-order products</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">Custom-fabricated, made-to-order, installed, or specially sourced products cannot normally be returned because a customer has changed their mind. They remain covered by the 30-day free maintenance window for faults caused by our product or installation.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900">Maintenance plans</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">We offer monthly maintenance subscriptions for high-use or high-maintenance equipment that may need regular servicing. Contact us for a plan suited to your equipment and operating conditions.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900">How to request a return or repair</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">Do not send equipment back without approval. Contact us with your name, order details, installation date, a description of the issue, and photographs or video where useful. We will review the request, confirm whether it is covered, and explain the next steps.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">Email <a class="font-bold text-orange-600 hover:text-orange-700" href="mailto:info@kitchenandall.co.ke">info@kitchenandall.co.ke</a> or message us on <a class="font-bold text-orange-600 hover:text-orange-700" href="https://wa.me/254741045143" target="_blank">WhatsApp</a>.</p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>